<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγᾰμ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>additional marriage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.560c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>connexion</i>
			<i>by marriage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.1.1
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.12.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>right</i>
			<i>of intermarriage</i> between states, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγαμίας . . καὶ ἐπεργασίας καὶ
					ἐπινομίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.2.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθαναίοις δόμεν
			ἐπιγαμίαν</span> Decr.Byz. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.91
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5040
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hierapytna</span>), Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. = Lat. <i>conubium</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				265.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.: generally, <i>intermarriage</i>,
			mostly pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγαμίας ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.147
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.5.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. Decr. ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.187
			</span></i> (sg.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐβοεῦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					34.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.2.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1280b16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγαμίαις χρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1280b36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
